{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794550348587,"sessionID":"ses_e2c7999e1ffeYcD6BDSYeMhQPJ","part":{"partID":"prt_1d389344c00198ILcInfTSCAn7","sessionID":"ses_e2c7999e1ffeYcD6BDSYeMhQPJ","messageID":"msg_1d388b5a1001qpsUUxRgCGMOLn","type":"tool","id":"call_b81a1c8925084ec78f81183a","tool":"grep","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"pattern":"mutating|commandPolicy|command_policy|attachCommand|typedCommandForTop|routeNeedsMode","path":".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime","include":"*.ts","limit":80},"output":"Found 80 matches\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/handlers/advisor-recommend.ts:\n  Line 13: import { TRACKED_COMMANDS, attachCommand, commandRowFor, routeNeedsMode, typedCommandForTop } from '../lib/command-attach.js';\n\n  Line 472:       const command = attachCommand(recommendation.skillId, compiledRoute, prompt);\n\n  Line 480:         : { ...recommendation, compiledRoute, ...(!command && routeNeedsMode(recommendation.skillId, compiledRoute) ? { needsMode: true as const } : {}) };\n\n  Line 495:   const typed = typedCommandForTop(top.skillId, prompt);\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/stress-test/skill-advisor/scorer-extras-stress.vitest.ts:\n  Line 76:   it('runs lane-by-lane ablation without mutating live scorer weights', () => {\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/stress-test/skill-advisor/auto-indexing-derived-sync-stress.vitest.ts:\n  Line 204:   it('sa-011 syncs many graph-metadata derived blocks without mutating SKILL.md sources', () => {\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/doctor-command-bridges.vitest.ts:\n  Line 45:     readonly mutating?: string;\n\n  Line 52:     readonly mutating?: stri